menu "Xiaomiao Agent"

    config XIAOMIAO_AGENT_HOST
        string "Xiaomiao Agent IPv4 address"
        default ""
        help
            IPv4 text of the PC running the unified Xiaomiao Agent
            (four dotted decimal groups, e.g. 192.168.1.x). An empty
            string means unconfigured: the Agent Service stays in
            UNCONFIGURED and never sends requests. The reproducible
            configuration keeps this empty on purpose; put the real
            LAN address only into the ignored local sdkconfig (goal
            node 11, decision 3).

    config XIAOMIAO_AGENT_PORT
        int "Xiaomiao Agent TCP port"
        range 1 65535
        default 8766
        help
            TCP port of the Xiaomiao Agent HTTP backend. The PC Agent
            defaults to the same port 8766 (goal node 11, decision 1).

endmenu